      "reason": "The Medicine Education d6 pool directly computes healing inside one Extended Action transaction that also drains AP, removes one selected condition, revalidates actor/target revisions, and journals item evidence. Replacing it with a separately accepted document would split spend, healing, condition, and roll authority and permit stale reuse."
    },
    {
